			"Message": "docs(Common): Revise CHANGELOG with narrative formatting\n\nRestructure the CHANGELOG to use a more readable, narrative-driven\nformat inspired by Keep a Changelog. Changes include:\n\n- Add introductory paragraph explaining Common's purpose\n- Rewrite version headers from [Common/vX.X] to [vX.X]\n- Convert bullet-point changes to flowing prose descriptions\n- Align all version entries with consistent voice and structure\n\nThe revision improves readability while preserving all historical\nchange information.",
			"SHA": "fd25cb4984b7f0a88f9af1005630aaa7aa207a27"
		},
		{
			"Author": "Nikola Hristov",
			"Date": "2026-04-29T04:00:29Z",
			"File": [
				"⠀⠀⠀⠀⠀",
				342,
				1
			],
			"Message": "feat(Common): Add Identifier field to SourceControlManagementProviderDTO\n\nAdd a new `Identifier` field to the SourceControlManagementProviderDTO struct to support provider identification (\"git\", \"github\", \"hg\", etc.). This field maps to the `scmId` in the `sky://scm/register` event payload, enabling Cocoon's `ScmShimRegistry` to properly re-emit events during Sky boot race conditions when late listeners register.\n\nThe field defaults to empty for backwards compatibility with existing DTOs.",
			"SHA": "247f5126c2024987e1570b2cdc6d0384502c9986"
		},
